<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
html { background: #ffffff; }
body {
  width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
  background: #F4F6F6;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  display: flex;
}
.header {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 70pt;
  background: #1C2833;
  padding: 20pt 40pt;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.header h1 {
  font-size: 28pt;
  color: #F4F6F6;
  margin: 0;
}
.content {
  position: absolute;
  top: 70pt; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
  padding: 25pt 40pt 40pt 40pt;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.layout {
  display: flex;
  gap: 25pt;
  height: 100%;
}
.left {
  flex: 1;
}
.right {
  flex: 1;
}
.card {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-left: 6pt solid #70AD47;
  border-radius: 8pt;
  padding: 15pt;
  margin-bottom: 15pt;
  box-shadow: 0 2pt 6pt rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}
.card h2 {
  font-size: 15pt;
  color: #1C2833;
  margin: 0 0 8pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.card p {
  font-size: 12pt;
  color: #2E4053;
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.stats {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10pt;
  margin-top: 10pt;
}
.stat-box {
  flex: 1;
  background: #F0F6F0;
  padding: 10pt;
  border-radius: 6pt;
  text-align: center;
}
.stat-box .number {
  font-size: 18pt;
  color: #70AD47;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin: 0;
}
.stat-box .label {
  font-size: 10pt;
  color: #2E4053;
  margin: 5pt 0 0 0;
}
.chart-container {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 10pt;
  padding: 15pt;
  box-shadow: 0 2pt 8pt rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  height: 100%;
}
.chart-container h3 {
  font-size: 14pt;
  color: #1C2833;
  margin: 0 0 10pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <h1>红利资产：确定性的避风港</h1>
</div>
<div class="content">
  <div class="layout">
    <div class="left">
      <div class="card">
        <h2>🛡️ 配置逻辑</h2>
        <p>• 低利率环境下，高股息资产吸引力显著提升<br>
           • 类债券属性，提供稳定现金流回报<br>
           • 估值低、波动小，适合作为组合防御资产</p>
        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stat-box">
            <p class="number">5-6%</p>
            <p class="label">股息率</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-box">
            <p class="number">10-15x</p>
            <p class="label">PE估值</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-box">
            <p class="number">低</p>
            <p class="label">波动率</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h2>📈 数据支撑</h2>
        <p>• 2025年广东上市公司分红总额创历史新高<br>
           • A股高股息策略连续3年跑赢大盘<br>
           • 央企分红率提升至35%以上，股东回报意识增强</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="right">
      <div class="chart-container" id="dividend-chart" class="placeholder" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
